  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishiunye Yesu oltung'ani omuei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa te sabato nabo nelo ninye ainos endaa te nkaji o Lfarisayoi obo kitok, te nkolong e nkiyeng'iyeng'ata, neing'or ninche aajur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ng'ura, etii oltung'ani dukuya ninye otejia osesen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirorie Yesu lang'eni loo nkitanapat o Lfarisayo, ajoki, “Keishoruno pasa too nkitanapat meishiunyeki oltung'ani te nkolong e sabato anaa ai meishoruno?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etigirate ninche. Neibung ilo tung'ani neishiunye, neisho meshomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 12.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki ninche, “Ai ng'ae te ntae laa te neeta enkurrarru anaa olkiteng otusulakine olkesumet lemesaru nabo kata aitayu, oi aa te nkolong e sabato.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelaikino aatawaliki ina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emborron o nkaminino",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki aliki enkitanyaanyukoto lelo ooitoomoni, etoduaa eneiko tenegelaki ate iwuejitin lorikan ooilepie, nejoki ninche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.25.6+PRO.25.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ndung 25.6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Te nikimpotokini osirua le nkiama, mitonie ake ewueji enkanyit, melotu ake likae oipoto kitok likilang; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nelotu ilo oipoto ntae, pokira oare, nikijoki, ‘Nchoo sii iyie ele tung'ani enetonie,’ nintoki iyie adou te nkurruna alo ewueji e abori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore iyie pee kimpoti, totona te wueji nebayie tukul, paa te nelotu ilo oitoomonisho nikijoki, ‘Olchore, ilepa sii iyie;’ nikiyanyitu esiamo pooki niboitare te mesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 23.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 18.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ore pooki oilepie kewan neitadouni, ore oloitadou kewan neilepieki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki sii ninye ilo oitoomonisho, “Te nincho ltung'ana endaa aashu ntobiraki osirua, mimpot lchoreta linono o lalashera linono o lelo lo lmarei lino aashu lkarsisi le latia ino, pee mikiyooki sii ninche aaitoomon, nikilaaki enda apa nintaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ti nintobir iyie osirua, mpoto laisinak, o ltarrushi o lng'ojiniaa o lmodook, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa eikimayiani amu mikindim ninche aatalaaki iyie. Aikilaakini kenya ake te mpiunoto e lelo supati.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkitanyaanyukoto o sirua kitok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ening ina obo le lelo ootoni te mesa, nejoki, “Emayiana ilo oyooki adaa te nkitoria e Nkai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka ninye ilo, “Etii apa oltung'ani oitobira osirua kitok, neipot iltung'ana kumok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore pee ebau enkata e ilo sirua neirriwaa olaisiaayiani lenye metiaaki lelo ooipotoki, ‘Wootu; amu eirrag pooki toki!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eiterutua pooki aaitaakuuk. Nejo ole dukuya, ‘Ainyang'ua enkurma, naa kalo ake adol; aatasayia tung'ueikiaki nanu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo likae, ‘Ainyang'ua nanu lmong'i tomon naa kalo pee alo asipu; aatasayia tung'ueikiaki nanu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo likae, ‘Enayamie enkitok, nemaidim naa aeu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaae, nelotu olaisiaayiani aliki olkitok lenye nena. Negoro olopeny enkaji nejoki olaisiaayiani lenye, ‘Tasiooi shomo nkoitoi oo nkaulele e ina anasa, toriku laisinak o ltarrushi o lmodook o lng'ojiniaa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ilo aisiaayiani, ‘Lo kitok, eidipaki aataas ina natejo, neton ake meiputa enkaji.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olkitok ilo aisiaayiani lenye, ‘Shomo nkoitoi sapuki o nkutiti, o lkirinen taaru ltung'ana meetu, o meiputayu enkaji ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ajoki ntae, meishiamisham hoo obo le lelo apa ooipotokoki endaa ai.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ti nitaa oloiteng'eni le Yesu, midutie ai toki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eiriamariyie olorora kitok, neibelekenyakino nejoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10.37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore pooki ng'ae olotu enatii lemeibayu menye o ng'otonye, o enkitok enye o nkera, o lalashera o nkanashera, ee o ebaiki enkorrok enye, nemeidim ataa oloiteng'eni lai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.8.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 8.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 9.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore pooki lemenap osalaba lenye naairukurukore, nemeidim ataa oloiteng'eni lai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kalo pasa linyi, laa te neyieu neshetu oltalet, lemeng'as aton aikenisho pee eyiolou te naa keidip intokitin naata? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pee meaku ake, ore eidipa aitamanyu nelaikino aidipa, nesukeny pooki ng'ae odol, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ejo, ‘Eiterua ele tung'ani ashetisho, neitu eidip.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaa kalo aiguanani oyieu nerasaki likae aiguanani to larrabal, eitu eng'as aiguana te naa keirish ilenyena iip tomon, iip tikitam le lido oarare? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa te nemeirish, ore eton eitu enyiku olikae, neirriwaki lkiliku aikilikuanu mbaa naaitayu osotua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neijia naa etiu, ore ake olinyi lemeibayu pooki toki naata nemeidim ataa olaiteng'eni lai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emunyan nemeeta tipat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ai sidai emunyan; kake amaa te netuyiatuyu emunyan kerrinyokinoyu enkisukut enye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meitoki aata tipat te nkurma nemeeta to lchala; keiturrarri ake. Oloata nkiyiaa naaning'ie inchoo ening.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
